# The platform image set — the SINGLE SOURCE both substrates read (P19 Decision 2).
#
# Docker Compose reads these as env vars; the Kubernetes base pins the same digests in its
# `kustomization.yaml` `images:` block. A CI check (scripts/deploy/check-image-parity.sh) fails the
# build if the two substrates reference different digests or a different image set — so "it works on
# compose but not the cluster" is always a TOPOLOGY question, never an IMAGE question.
#
# 🔴 EVERY IMAGE IS PINNED BY DIGEST, NOT A FLOATING TAG. A tag moves; a digest is the artifact. An
# apply of the same digest twice yields the same running image, which is the reproducibility NFR9 buys.
# The `-#pin:<tag>` trailing comment records the human-readable tag the digest was cut from, for the
# release notes — it is documentation, never what is applied.
#
# The platform's own three images (agentd, console, admin-console) are pinned by the RELEASE PIPELINE
# (out of P19 scope) when it publishes them; the digests below are format-valid placeholders that the
# pipeline replaces. The backing-store images are third-party and pinned here directly. Repin any of
# them deliberately, in a commit, with the new digest recorded — never by editing a tag.

# ── Platform images ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Built from commit 63a3a03 for linux/arm64 (Graviton t4g nodes) and pushed to this account's ECR.
# The repositories are IMMUTABLE-tagged, so `63a3a03` can never be made to point at different bytes.
#
# 63a3a03 is the v0.22.0 release line: the DocumentedRelease bump (#95) plus the install page
# regenerated from the published Release (#97). Both consoles AND agentd move together because
# internal/api/install.go serves its install surface from distribution.DocumentedRelease — a
# console-only push would leave the API answering v0.21.0 behind a page showing v0.22.0.
AGENTD_IMAGE=373468206837.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/agentd@sha256:bbea04e8dc8c8c722a74dd022ebf98b6eda3f5ecb64f4456157065cd16382f67 #pin:90b97d1
CONSOLE_IMAGE=373468206837.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/heros-console@sha256:e882d793d83d442fbd1a39e7ff7fa1450ff6173105a7cd4b2cd4c30a027b751e #pin:63a3a03
ADMIN_CONSOLE_IMAGE=373468206837.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/heros-admin-console@sha256:f4bacae454eb73f8550f1ea9197753110577aa727d5a2ce93c1457791b67f527 #pin:d04a09f

# ── Backing stores (third-party; pinned here) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
